<title>PORTUGAL: Banco Comercial Portugues H1 results due July 22.</title>
<headline>Banco Comercial Portugues H1 results due July 22.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Comercial Portugues (BCP) will present its first half results on July 22, a bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>The results will be released after the market closes.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
